s provided in Table 6. The intraspecific uncorrected p - distances ranged from 0.0 – 3.8 %. The greatest intraspecific genetic divergence of 3.4 - 3.8 % was encountered in Dario hysginon between the northern population from the type locality and additional locations in Kachin State, and the southern population in the Ayeyarwaddy delta with an aerial distance between them of almost 1000 km. Even the populations from the type locality and that of Lake Indawgyi showed a divergence of around 2 %. Interspecific distances among the species of Dario ranged from 14.1 – 19.0 %.","","text","",""]]},"NN8N5":{"v":[["granskottgnagare","swe",0],["grankonglebille","nob",0],["käpykytry","fin",0],["Grankoglebille","dan",0],["Stukacz świerkowiec","pol",0],["červotoč šiškový","ces",0],["črvotoč šuškový","slk",0],["Точильщик еловых шишек","rus",0],["トウヒノシバンムシ","jpn",0]]},"PB9HD":{"v":[["진주창고치벌","kor",0]]},"PCPT":{"v":[["Plains Reedgrass","eng",0],["calamagrostide du Montana","fra",0]],"d":[["","ABT","tdwg","",""],["","BRC","tdwg","",""],["","COL","tdwg","",""],["","IDA","tdwg","",""],["","MAN","tdwg","",""],["","MIN","tdwg","",""],["","MNT","tdwg","",""],["","NDA","tdwg","",""],["","SAS","tdwg","",""],["","SDA","tdwg","",""],["","WYO","tdwg","",""]]},"QSMF":{"v":[["Savanna Nightjar","eng",0],["Cabak kota","ind",0],["Chotacabras de sabana","spa",0],["Engoulevent affin","fra",0],["Savan Çobanaldatanı","tur",0],["Savannenachtzwaluw","nld",0],["Savannenatravn","dnj",0],["Savannennachtschwalbe","deu",0],["Savanski leganj","srp",0],["Succiacapre di savana","ita",0],["enganyapastors de sabana","cat",0],["gressnattravn","nor",0],["lelek krótkosterny","pol",0],["lelek savanový","ces",0],["lelek stepný","slk",0],["noitibó-da-savana","por",0],["rohtla-öösorr","est",0],["savana kaprimulgo","epo",0],["savaninis lėlys","lit",0],["savannattskärra","swe",0],["savannikehrääjä","fin",0],["szavanna lappantyú","hun",0],["travnjački leganj","hrv",0],["Саванный козодой","rus",0],["дрімлюга савановий","ukr",